      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCY'S MATE (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Ravina Wolf (20.01) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature in the finish again. SHIMMERING MISS (5) recorded a 2.25 lengths third in a Maiden last time 19.97 at this track and trip and also jumping from the same draw. Can measure up. MONEY MOMENT (6) has her first outing without a trial but profiles nicely for this. Bold showing expected here. BUNDY ON ICE (7) makes debut for the John Clarson kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Market should provide a lead to his ability.",
